1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:13,145
Speaking, task three. Story number 18: Moving to the Czech Republic. How did the Kovalenko family move to the Czech Republic? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:16,196
How did the Kovalenko family move to the Czech Republic?

3
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,867
The Kovalenko family moved from Ukraine to the Czech Republic.

4
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:41,567
At home they packed suitcases.

5
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:44,854
They took clothes, documents and a few toys for their son.

6
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:47,199
Then they went to the Czech Republic by bus.

7
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,000
The journey was long, it took almost two days.

8
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,489
Everyone was tired.

9
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,751
Finally they arrived in Kralupy.

10
00:00:53,967 --> 00:00:56,987
They saw their new flat, it was small but nice.

11
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,650
A week later their son went to a Czech school for the first time.

12
00:00:59,867 --> 00:01:03,159
He was nervous, but the teacher was kind and the day was good.

13
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:12,274
